A||||2||JohnnyK||Extra connector under console?||||1||
Z||000000||JohnnyK||11-30-2000||01:26 PM||||I am curious as to what the extra connectors are under the console. There is a small clip coming off the cigarette lighter that doesn't connect to anything, and I think I remember a big connector not connected to anything, but I could be wrong. Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||11-30-2000||01:31 PM||||There should be three things attached to the cigarette lighter......2 plugs and a light bulb.<P>There is a larger plug close to the ECM......this is where the cruise control harness plugs into. If your Fiero doesn't have cruise, then this plug won't be attached to anything.  <p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 11-30-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Indiana_resto_guy||11-30-2000||01:33 PM||||Small clip off the cig. lighter? The only one that I can think of if it's on the outside of lighter housing, it's the ground for the lighter (without it, lighter won't work!).<BR>Big connector? If it's screwed down, it's the ADAL connector.||||reg||1
